		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hunched ogre with a wolfen head and long, wicked claws. Mythic creature of the fens.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +7 (3d10 + grab) or dismember, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dismember</strong>. Grabbed target, CON 15+ or random limb is torn off. 3d10 damage and 2d6 damage per round from blood loss unless healed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
